<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Biochemistry Digest</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: #f7f5f0;
            color: #202522;
            font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        }

        header {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #d8d5ce;
            padding: 24px 6%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: #f7f5f0;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #202522;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 24px;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #356b5a;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 80px 6%;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #356b5a;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 88px);
            line-height: 0.95;
            letter-spacing: -4px;
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 0 0 28px;
        }

        .intro {
            font-size: 21px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 680px;
            color: #555b57;
        }

        .divider {
            margin: 70px 0 45px;
            border-top: 1px solid #d8d5ce;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #6b706c;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .featured {
            background: #e7eee9;
            padding: 42px;
            max-width: 800px;
        }

        .featured h2 {
            font-size: 38px;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin: 10px 0 20px;
        }

        .featured p {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #4e5551;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #356b5a;
            margin-right: 12px;
        }

        .read-more {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 12px;
            color: #202522;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #202522;
            padding-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .columns {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 24px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }

        .card {
            border-top: 1px solid #d8d5ce;
            padding-top: 24px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            font-size: 25px;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #5d625f;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid #d8d5ce;
            padding: 35px 6%;
            margin-top: 80px;
            color: #777;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            header {
                display: block;
            }

            nav {
                margin-top: 15px;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 0 18px 0 0;
            }

            main {
                padding-top: 50px;
            }

            h1 {
                letter-spacing: -2px;
            }

            .featured {
                padding: 28px;
            }

            .columns {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">Biochemistry Digest</div>

    <nav>
        <a href="#">Digest</a>
        <a href="#">Research</a>
        <a href="#">Topics</a>
        <a href="#">Conversations</a>
        <a href="#">My Papers</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<main>

    <div class="eyebrow">Weekly Research & Ideas</div>

    <h1>Interesting things happening in biochemistry.</h1>

    <p class="intro">
        A curated collection of new research papers, articles,
        conversations, and ideas worth exploring — with explanations
        of what they mean and why they matter.
    </p>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="section-title">
        Featured this week
    </div>

    <section class="featured">

        <span class="tag">Protein Folding</span>
        <span class="tag">Research</span>

        <h2>
            What happens when a protein tries to find its way home?
        </h2>

        <p>
            This week's featured research explores the mechanisms
            underlying protein refolding and what they can tell us
            about how proteins recover their functional structures.
        </p>

        <a class="read-more" href="#">
            Read the breakdown →
        </a>

    </section>

    <div class="columns">

        <article class="card">
            <div class="section-title">New Research</div>

            <h3>
                Papers worth knowing about
            </h3>

            <p>
                Short explanations of interesting new findings,
                including the purpose of the study, what researchers
                discovered, and why it matters.
            </p>

            <a class="read-more" href="#">
                Explore research →
            </a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
            <div class="section-title">Topic</div>

            <h3>
                Protein Folding
            </h3>

            <p>
                Explore papers, articles, conversations, and
                foundational ideas connected to one of the most
                fascinating problems in molecular biology.
            </p>

            <a class="read-more" href="#">
                Explore topic →
            </a>
        </article>

    </div>

</main>

<footer>
    Biochemistry Digest · Research, ideas & conversations
</footer>

</body>
</html>
